          "body": "Major depressive disorder (MDD) involves a persistent change in mood and functioning. The pattern includes depressed mood or loss of interest/pleasure, with at least five depressive symptoms occurring most of the day, nearly every day, for at least two weeks. Assess the full syndrome and exclude other explanations; duration alone does not establish the diagnosis.",
