          "title": "Understand the pattern",
          "body": "An adolescent may appear irritable or angry, withdraw from friends, decline in school, lose interest in usual activities, or report headaches/stomachaches. Do not dismiss this pattern as ordinary misconduct. Compare behavior with the person's baseline.",
