          "title": "Epstein-Barr virus (EBV)",
          "body": "Epstein-Barr virus (EBV) commonly causes infectious mononucleosis, often called mono or the kissing disease. Saliva is a major transmission route; close contact and shared saliva-contaminated items matter.",
