          "title": "Kawasaki disease",
          "body": "Kawasaki disease is systemic blood-vessel inflammation of uncertain cause, possibly an exaggerated immune response in a susceptible child. The major long-term concern is coronary artery dilation or aneurysm, with risk of thrombosis and myocardial injury.",
