          "title": "Connect it to nursing care",
          "body": "Assess behavior over time, across settings, and in developmental context. Gather information about aggression, weapons, self-harm, substance use, family stress, trauma, peers, and coexisting learning or mental-health needs. These factors guide care and do not excuse harm. Assess the safety of the child and other people instead of using a moral label such as bad child.",
